<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-24T16:46:07.227Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 16:46:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen killed an NSCDC officer and abducted a businessman in Plateau despite a curfew, and they attacked an Ebonyi assembly candidate convoy, killing one and wounding three. In Benue, Senate leaders are demanding a security overhaul and troop deployment after 113 people were killed, while electricity workers withdrew services in Makurdi following an alleged attack. Bandits continue to hold a widow, her son and a newborn captive three weeks after a kidnapping in Kaduna, and a NDC supporter was killed in Enugu. Floods killed 245 people and displaced over 200,000, according to NEMA, and the conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPdDZORDh0Y0V5N1dWRnl0NVlFSGktX2JvZWt2S0VKUWk0MkV1Y0dWUXp4M016QkJLWmRFS0Q4N3hpcWpNRlpQTDFJMDZhaG85RENJQlZTd1piQU40ZkhJQ1dLR2pZdEloVnluY1k2QnhERzFyZ1VPc0NfVVNTektuQnlYdTdjeE9f?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOMFk0enRkelZfRmk3UmpqYlg5Z1RSaHpWbVVjSFBFVFg1enh1alBoRHFDTlI5RG5vVFNjZHZjQUJyZFEyeXBYdjJGTDRZTHg3X3BncExiSUFJT1ZNYWY3UUhPX2t5WXVVRFlwZHRaaEZKbUpSUnlZSk5WTkNxZGt0eTV6Q3Z4ZWFqdS1jZWF0ZEpia0ctLTRuY0UyTlZzSkN4UHByVl93bVdGaUxTd1lQOU1vZTcyTUpKa1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPVXItNmFOcy1xTnAzMnJzNXpXQ193ZWZSWGp4U0tPVGd4Slc5aS02Zk5EYUtTbmJRemNqczhVdEdzTzYtQndLWEVHaUZjTHhZZFA5alFhZV9aX3NZdE1LcTBIb2huR1JWWnlPX3JGdDltZTAxODlGZ012T0doQmlZQlBoWFFIMTl1d3dVRElCQVNmMXpqeXRDRkNoZEEyaFJrZUlEWWFkUklXdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOd2YwZU1KRWo5VlFWOUowVkotT3M4REFsT01YNVNDa3Z1SlFNOXpHRlRHQy0zR1FLWUVMQ2I5RFZianpEdFMzakVVZVdqWTBDQ1dyTkE